/* 4 根竖条底部对齐、高度 1/4 → 满高递增；点亮为深色、未亮为浅灰（同 iPhone 信号格） */
.signal-bars {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: flex-end;
  vertical-align: middle;
}

.signal-bars__bar {
  background: #d5d9df;
  border-radius: 2rpx;
}

.signal-bars__bar.is-on {
  background: #2a2d32;
}

.signal-bars--normal {
  height: 26rpx;
}

.signal-bars--normal .signal-bars__bar {
  width: 6rpx;
  margin-left: 4rpx;
}

.signal-bars--small {
  height: 20rpx;
}

.signal-bars--small .signal-bars__bar {
  width: 5rpx;
  margin-left: 3rpx;
}

.signal-bars__bar:nth-child(1) {
  height: 25%;
  margin-left: 0;
}

.signal-bars__bar:nth-child(2) {
  height: 50%;
}

.signal-bars__bar:nth-child(3) {
  height: 75%;
}

.signal-bars__bar:nth-child(4) {
  height: 100%;
}
